 of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"AML"},{"text":"Client verification"},{"text":"Risk controls"},{"text":"Market-conduct rules"},{"text":"Record keeping"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory for entry-level brokerage roles."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful options:"},{"type":"table","header":["PG","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Com Finance"},{"text":"Finance depth"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Markets + management"}],[{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"Advanced finance"}],[{"text":"MSc Financial Markets"},{"text":"Capital markets specialisation"}],[{"text":"MBA Financial Markets"},{"text":"Market-focused management"}],[{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Finance + data"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For investment-oriented progression, CFA + relevant experience can be more directly aligned than a generic postgraduate degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's pathways:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Financial Markets"},{"text":"MSc Investment Management"},{"text":"MSc Financial Economics"},{"text":"MSc Quantitative Finance"},{"text":"MSc Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc FinTech"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For regulated financial-market roles, always check the destination country's licensing and regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Brokerage route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com Financial Markets"},{"type":"h","text":"Brokerage Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Stock Broker Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Dealer / Brokerage Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Trading Desk Manager"},{"type":"h",